<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
Synthetic XML Component Description for TypeSink (tools/rtegen RTE-04 host test), written by hand in the style of
the Embedded Coder export. It receives the record Stat and the array Scaled of TypeSwc in another task and reads
Scaled from two tasks; its data types are those of TypeSwc (TypeSink_datatype.arxml, copy of TypeSwc_datatype.arxml).
Init values: NUMERICAL (Check = 7), TEXT (LastMode = TypeSwc_Mode_Run), APPLICATION (LastTemp = 25.5 degC, stored
655), none (zero).
-->
